#. comic426 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:34
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#title.1"
msgid "\"KNOCK THREE TIMES\""
msgstr "«ПОСТУЧИ ТРИ РАЗА»"

#. comic426 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: msheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:71
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p1.1"
msgid "The random search for allies continues..."
msgstr "Беспорядочные поиски союзников продолжаются…"

#. comic426 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: msheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p1.2"
msgid "Um, hi everyone. We're here on sort of a recruiting mission."
msgstr "Э-э, всем привет. Мы тут, можно сказать, набираем добровольцев."

#. comic426 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: msheenatable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p2.1"
msgid "See, we're trying to find sprites with unique powers who would like to help us overthrow an evil empire."
msgstr "Понимаете, мы ищем спрайтов с уникальными способностями, которые захотят помочь нам свергнуть злую империю."

#. comic426 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: msheenabtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:185
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p3.1"
msgid "So if any of you think you would qualify, and are interested in joining in, please volunteer!"
msgstr "Так что если кто-то из вас считает, что подходит, и хочет к нам присоединиться — вызывайтесь!"

#. comic426 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: slime.gif, msheenaleft.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:237
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p4.1"
msgid "Uh, one jiggle for yes, two for no?"
msgstr "Дрогни раз — «да», два — «нет»?"

#. comic426 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: slime.gif, msheenaleft.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:239
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p4.2"
msgid "I think this one said, \"Okay.\""
msgstr "Вроде этот сказал: «Ладно»."

#. comic426 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: slime.gif, msheenaleft.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic426.htm:241
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic426#p4.3"
msgid "<b>GrglGrglGr!</b></font><font size=\"1\" face=\"arial\"><br><b>*</b>(Mmm! Tasties!)"
msgstr "<b>ХлюпХлюп!</b></font><font size=\"1\" face=\"arial\"><br><b>*</b>(Ммм! Вкусно!)"

#. comic427 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic427.htm:47
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic427#title.1"
