msgstr "Извини, мне сначала надо выстрелить пару сотен раз."

#. comic428 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: heyslime4.gif, bslime2.gif
#: kidradd/comic428.htm:154
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic428#p2.2"
msgid "Then start shooting!"
msgstr "Так начинай стрелять!"

#. comic428 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic428.htm:202
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic428#p3.1"
msgid "Did the Mega Radd work?"
msgstr "Мега-Улёт сработал?"

#. comic428 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic428.htm:206
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic428#p3.2"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "Не-а."

#. comic428 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: heyslime5.gif, bslime.gif
#: kidradd/comic428.htm:287
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic428#p5.1"
