msgstr "<b>Больно же!</b>"

#. comic428 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: heyslime5.gif, bslime.gif
#: kidradd/comic428.htm:291
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic428#p5.2"
msgid "Sheesh, as if you'd never felt pain befo- ...Oh, right."
